    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if it isn't just a phase? what if the well is actually dry? i feel like i'm just going through the motions of a person who doesn't exist anymore. it feels like the \"real work\" you're talking about is just a lie we tell ourselves to keep moving when there's nothing left.",
